{"id":4586,"date":"2025-07-07T08:10:28","date_gmt":"2025-07-07T08:10:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4586"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:56:29","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:56:29","slug":"cach-mua-hang-tren-amazon","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/cach-mua-hang-tren-amazon\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon si\u00eau \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"F3uzdYspkoje63x6l4vlDUbKgVZ\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OXLDdZS2qoWrxixIPEslqeQFgCe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon l\u00e0 s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. V\u1edbi Amazon, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u0103ng doanh thu n\u1ebfu bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch khai th\u00e1c \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch. T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay c\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a>!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UgQBdl996oGxlexmhmilniJggkh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">S\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kq9XdVVwdokLcDxLfSXlaR36g5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Amazon<\/strong> l\u00e0 s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp n\u0103m 1994 t\u1ea1i M\u1ef9. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ebfn h\u01a1n <strong>300 tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u<\/strong>. Amazon cung c\u1ea5p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 FBA (giao h\u00e0ng b\u1edfi Amazon), FBM (t\u1ef1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh), ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft, dropshipping\u2026 v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng kho b\u00e3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ChF3dDIzCoZENtxjRInlfrPPgMb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4567\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56.png\" alt=\"l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Amazon<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AFJOd91ovojHVJxQDiMlovHDgHL\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u g\u00ec \u1edf Amazon khi\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 tin c\u1eady?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UHvgd8cXoomPfmxCEislXewpgWh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u nh\u1edd s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1eadu m\u00e3i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i. T\u1eeb h\u01a1n 300 tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi kho h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng minh ph\u1ee7 kh\u1eafp th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, Amazon gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng mua s\u1eafm nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng ch\u1ec9 t\u1eeb 24 gi\u1edd, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi g\u00f3i Prime.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtFBd20spoRSfyxGjQTlqf5sgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3 minh b\u1ea1ch, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f4ng khai, c\u00f9ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 24\/7 g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng l\u00f2ng tin v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, Amazon cung c\u1ea5p m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh t\u1ed1i \u01b0u nh\u01b0 FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon), gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft m\u1ecdi v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 kho b\u00e3i, giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u00f2n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u chi ti\u1ebft, m\u1edf ra c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GKPTdUAFzohUGwxsXRxlqDFfgCe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa quy m\u00f4, t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9, \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd \u0111\u00e3 khi\u1ebfn Amazon tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady nh\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n nay.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3EGd6iRhoj3oSxNEKvlwdWegTf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Lb7IdEkS1oSO6CxGh4ZlN4Y3gxc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon c\u1ef1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqWBdQCJyorctLxWvSllVabjgTh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Mua s\u1eafm tr\u00ean Amazon l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u, \u0111\u1eebng lo l\u1eafng! D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon:<\/div>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-VazddBfccoWVtFxuS7ZlnuzEgye\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. T\u1ea1o T\u00e0i Kho\u1ea3n Amazon<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4588\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4588\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4588\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/65-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4588\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NO23dhEkzouw82xZPoel6XDQg9g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UIY2deYIroIx8sxnMlKlDqLagHg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a Amazon (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: amazon.com n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u1edf M\u1ef9, ho\u1eb7c <a href=\"http:\/\/amazon.co.jp\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">amazon.co.jp<\/a> n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u1edf Nh\u1eadt, v.v.).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PeZydN7ZYoynqQxXQgzlNSU1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00ecm v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o &#8220;Account &amp; Lists&#8221; (T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n &amp; Danh s\u00e1ch) \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E14wd6M5PoZyjkxZmX4l0Wtzgrh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn &#8220;Start here&#8221; (B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y) b\u00ean c\u1ea1nh &#8220;New customer?&#8221; (Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi?).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y3UbdGdugocgGoxC6jsle5bZgab\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1eadp t\u00ean, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SN1Nds2AGojRvZxUwU8lm9DTgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o &#8220;Create your Amazon account&#8221; (T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n). Amazon c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00e1c minh qua email ho\u1eb7c s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JqdldYRBrogdbZxIOtglmHZQgbe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. T\u00ecm Ki\u1ebfm S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BRaUdWyK0olReFx7yAKl8W30gub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm \u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u trang \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadp t\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc \u1edf b\u00ean tr\u00e1i \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u1eb9p k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div data-page-id=\"F3uzdYspkoje63x6l4vlDUbKgVZ\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LX6pdednioW78lxUaxelMTULgAe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. Xem Chi Ti\u1ebft S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IJWsdjgB3o7J1Xx2qYjl8Qf8gUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m do &#8220;Sold by Amazon&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Fulfilled by Amazon&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 y\u00ean t\u00e2m v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-IWhPdPJquoXCOnxqYgTluP7kgDe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. Th\u00eam V\u00e0o Gi\u1ecf H\u00e0ng &amp; Thanh To\u00e1n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MRMYdQ2u9or2MWxuzLqlMe8Bgeh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nh\u1ea5p &#8220;Add to Cart&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Buy Now&#8221;. Sau \u0111\u00f3, ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh thanh to\u00e1n, nh\u1eadp \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n (th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng\/ghi n\u1ee3 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf). Xem l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5p &#8220;Place your order&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XAA4dOu6Poqim5xyh18lpeolgvc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>5. Theo D\u00f5i \u0110\u01a1n H\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P6LydOTJjoj9oXx0SsRlurksgRh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c email x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn. V\u00e0o &#8220;Returns &amp; Orders&#8221; trong t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i v\u00e0 m\u00e3 theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CubvdN0DAoIi2Lx8HvQlvUzugqf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TBcrdWDWDoHy3LxOglnlpv7bgRc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u01afu, nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m khi mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SQaddNGLwoTWkJxvonElJ9UKgfe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G5Njdl0xCoDo6pxmXHHlvCz0gah\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111a d\u1ea1ng t\u1eeb to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OV6PdyJdVogur9xZ7eTlaI30gsb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 c\u1ea1nh tranh, nhi\u1ec1u khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn quanh n\u0103m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMXydhJ3AoRpQlxOW2gljRAdgHu\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n nhanh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEu2dX5izoRF08xFsk7lud90gXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z9E4dIVM3oYHdKxdetylFmzDgwf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 uy t\u00edn ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4569\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4569\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4569\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54.png\" alt=\"Amazon mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch nh\u01b0 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o, v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4569\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Amazon mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch nh\u01b0 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o, v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XvozdMqCFoC63Rx6n0flsQcdgJf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QnMZdjn7UoxkN4xqmMZlS3eKgUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng n\u00e0o c\u0169ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 giao v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PL2ydE8ExodDD4xprrol2LKkg7n\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u1ea7n th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf (Visa\/MasterCard).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZhMIdF6xsoLZlVx0nW7lyLcCgCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Th\u1eddi gian v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n l\u00e2u (7\u201330 ng\u00e0y n\u1ebfu t\u1ef1 mua).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpbsdSvYzoiRaUxx44JlLeaagnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Chi ph\u00ed ship v\u00e0 thu\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cao, d\u1ec5 ph\u00e1t sinh ph\u00ed \u1ea9n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S5vAdqS2sovV5qxrrFUlgkiug0b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nguy c\u01a1 mua nh\u1ea7m h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3 t\u1eeb seller b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E71NdFbhIoPElyx1TJelaLH6gNf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UIf2duhxVoQ2kWxRuvcla3pIgzb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd khi mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L78qd6Wn0o3jJHxAHZyl1tADgEh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n uy t\u00edn: \u01afu ti\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u201cShips from and sold by Amazon\u201d ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t (4 sao tr\u1edf l\u00ean, nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t mua).<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NqX0dETdQoqOG5xqXfHlNK8CgRc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9 ph\u00ed ship &amp; thu\u1ebf: Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi thanh to\u00e1n, xem t\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf, ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, v\u00e0 ph\u00ed h\u1ea3i quan n\u1ebfu ship v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxbNdgc5oojrOkxwxUSlumKMgYb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0o c\u0169ng g\u1eedi qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf: M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n ra ngo\u00e0i M\u1ef9.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxKxdOgoOorGANxqRJ3l7haJgZc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u1ea9n tr\u1ecdng v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3: N\u00ean \u0111\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua tr\u01b0\u1edbc, tr\u00e1nh seller m\u1edbi ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng tin.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1icdicc7oIilyxZBV7l81qHgBf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u1ea7n th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf: Amazon kh\u00f4ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 COD, ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eadn Visa\/MasterCard, AMEX ho\u1eb7c th\u1ebb qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Amazon.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrYcdOZmKoN9rExjsrWlHn74gGh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo d\u00f5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean: Nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 khi mua qua b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ship trung gian.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FS5BdkFnFoRLlQxNSf2liWRXg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzJDdzpIgohufsxZwFzlKACYgic\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ATbtdlzU1otaZ7xnb0kllmwWg1m\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVrYdBed4oDVwhxHDSSlWqUYggm\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tj06dGYfholok7xDotNlJllOgFh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EV4KdBxUMoUViHx1qz5lSJI6g7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Amazon l\u00e0 s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. V\u1edbi Amazon, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u0103ng doanh thu n\u1ebfu bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch khai th\u00e1c \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch. T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4780,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[31,1],"tags":[],"cl